>o Conversely, dexterity should give a bonus to AC á la slashem

NHIND&D.

>o Protection should only be purchasable from a priest of one's own
>alignment -- why would a hostile God give you help?

This makes the game much harder; there is no guarantee that you will
find *any* co-aligned temples.  Besides, any priest likes money.  There's
always another hole to fix in the church roof, or another ikon to get 
repainted because it's been worn down by the touch of the faithful, or
whatever.

>o Ravens should be peaceful for Valkyries (Odin's special bird)

Nice touch.

